<div class="prasanthi-border"></div>

  <div class="container dashboard-container">
    
    <div class="hero-banner">
      <div class="hero-img-container">
        <img src="./images/logo.png" alt="Bhagwan Baba" class="hero-image" onerror="this.src='/images/logo.png'">
      </div>
      <div class="hero-text">
        <h2 class="hero-subtitle">Sri Sathya Sai Seva Organisations, Gandhinagar</h2>
        <h1 class="hero-title">Bhajan Planner</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-img-container">
        <img src="/images/logo_birthday.png" alt="Logo" class="hero-image">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="menu-grid">
      <a href="/submit-form" class="menu-card card-pink">
        <div class="card-icon">🎤</div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <div class="card-title">Singer's zone</div>
          <div class="card-desc">Mark your Bhajans</div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/master-bank" class="menu-card card-blue">
        <div class="card-icon">📖</div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <div class="card-title">Bhajan Database</div>
          <div class="card-desc">Prashanthi Mandir Bhajans</div>
        </div>
      </a>
      
      <a href="/database" class="menu-card card-green">
        <div class="card-icon">🗃️</div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <div class="card-title">History</div>
          <div class="card-desc">Records - Gandhinagar Bhajan schedules</div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/admin-login" class="menu-card card-yellow">
        <div class="card-icon">🔐</div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <div class="card-title">Administration</div>
          <div class="card-desc">Schedular - Control Tower</div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Bulletin / Latest Updates Section -->
    <% if (typeof bulletins !== 'undefined' && bulletins && bulletins.length > 0) { %>
    <div class="bulletin-section">
      <div class="bulletin-section-header">
        <h3>📢 Latest Updates</h3>
        <a href="/bulletins" class="bulletin-view-all">View All →</a>
      </div>
      <% bulletins.forEach(function(b) { %>
        <% 
          const catInfo = (typeof CATEGORY_INFO !== 'undefined' && CATEGORY_INFO[b.category]) ? CATEGORY_INFO[b.category] : { label: 'Update', icon: '📢', color: '#4dabf7' };
          const isNew = b.published_at && (Date.now() - new Date(b.published_at).getTime()) < 5 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;
        %>
        <a href="/bulletins/<%= b.id %>" class="bulletin-card">
          <div class="bulletin-card-header">
            <span class="bulletin-category-badge" style="background:<%= catInfo.color %>"><%= catInfo.icon %> <%= catInfo.label %></span>
            <% if (isNew) { %><span class="bulletin-new-badge">🆕 NEW</span><% } %>
            <% if (b.is_pinned) { %><span class="bulletin-pin-badge">📌</span><% } %>
          </div>
          <h3 class="bulletin-card-title"><%= b.title %></h3>
          <div class="bulletin-card-date">
            <% if (b.published_at) { %>
              <%= new Date(b.published_at).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }) %>
            <% } %>
          </div>
        </a>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="sai-quote-card">
      <h3 class="quote-header" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">🕉️ The Spirit of Bhajan</h3>
      <p class="quote-text-para"><strong>BHARAT:</strong> The heart of singing lies in the union of Bha (Bhava/Feeling), Ra (Raga/Melody), and Ta (Taala/Rhythm). Remember: "A tune (raga) without feeling (bhava) is an infliction (roga)."</p>
      <p class="quote-text-para"><strong>Unity in Unison:</strong> We strive to merge our individual voices into a single wave of vibration. When we sing in one voice and one beat, we create a powerful demonstration of oneness.</p>
      <p class="quote-text-para"><strong>Global Purification:</strong> Sacred sound waves act as spiritual "antibiotics," destroying negative thoughts in the air and purifying the environment for the welfare of the world.</p>
      <p class="quote-text-para" style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><strong>Full-Throated Devotion:</strong> Sing with enthusiasm! Let your devotion resonate through full-throated participation.</p>

      <h3 class="quote-header conduct-header">📋 Singer's Code of Conduct</h3>
      <div class="conduct-list">
        <div class="conduct-item conduct-item--saffron">
          <strong class="conduct-label">⏳ Punctuality</strong>
          <p class="conduct-body">Singers must be seated and ready before the Veda Recitation concludes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="conduct-item conduct-item--sky">
          <strong class="conduct-label">🎹 Seating</strong>
          <p class="conduct-body">All instrumentalists must sit together in the designated section to ensure perfect synchronization.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="conduct-item conduct-item--sage">
          <strong class="conduct-label">🎵 The Format</strong>
          <ol class="conduct-format-list">
            <li>1st Speed: Sing each line twice.</li>
            <li>2nd Speed: Sing lines once; repeat the last line twice.</li>
            <li>3rd Speed: (If applicable) Sing with increased tempo.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <div class="conduct-item conduct-item--maroon">
          <strong class="conduct-label">🔉 Pitch (Sruti)</strong>
          <p class="conduct-body">Select a pitch that is comfortable for your range. Avoid straining your voice on high or low notes to maintain sweetness.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="conduct-item conduct-item--gold">
          <strong class="conduct-label">👏 Hand Claps</strong>
          <p class="conduct-body">Clap in rhythm! This act removes negative instincts from within and recharges us with divine energy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="conduct-item conduct-item--clay">
          <strong class="conduct-label">🔕 Silence</strong>
          <p class="conduct-body">Mobile phones must be on Silent Mode to maintain the sanctity of the atmosphere.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="conduct-footer">— Bhagwan Sri Sathya Sai Baba</div>
    </div>




    <div class="shanti-footer">
      <div class="shanti-main">
        <div class="motto">"Love All - Serve All"</div>
        <div class="shanti-baba-quote">
          "Bhajan must spread good-will, love, ecstasy; it must cleanse the polluted atmosphere; it must invite all to share in the joy and peace" — Baba
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="prayer">Samastha Loka Sukhino Bhavantu</div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <%- include('partials/site-footer') %>
